# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kannada Saathi — optional environment configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app is fully functional with NO environment variables at all. Every
# core feature (phrasebook, situations, role-play, quiz, favourites, offline
# "ask in English" assistant, browser speech APIs) works from bundled data.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` only if you want to override the deploy base path or plug
# the optional AI helper into your own proxy. Both are optional.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1) Static base path. The default './' already supports GitHub Pages style
#    sub-directory hosting (e.g. https://user.github.io/kannada-saathi/),
#    domain roots and plain folders. Override only for an unusual host.
#VITE_BASE_PATH=./

# 2) Optional AI conversation coach.
#    Leave unset (recommended for the demo) and the app uses its built-in
#    offline retrieval assistant over the bundled Kannada dataset.
#    Set it to YOUR OWN proxy URL; the proxy keeps the real model key on the
#    server side. Never put a provider secret in a frontend variable, because
#    anything prefixed with VITE_ is embedded in the shipped JavaScript.
#VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=
# Optional label shown in the UI so judges can see which mode is active.
#VITE_AI_MODEL_LABEL=
